  message: "Fixed in PR #3799 (merge 7985926d5b). Added eight kind-specific stable_id factories (make_{file,module,dependency,variable,export,project,interface,type}_stable_id) + populate_kind_stable_ids backstop wired into analyze.all_analyzers. Producers keep precedence. 18 property tests; 14493/14493 passed; coverage held. Additive only — STABLE_ID_SCHEME stays at v3. Awaits BROAD bakeoff to confirm 6.1% missing-stable_id rate -> 0% on self-analysis."  # 6bbd
